<p>HUSSAIN ASWS. AAYA SIRHANE UTHO ALI AKBAR ASWS.</p>

<p>HILAKE SHAANA KAHA KUCH KAHO ALI AKBAR ASWS.</p>

<p>
1. KYUN PAOU'N AISE RAGADTE HO QAAK PAR BETA.</p>

<p>HAI DIL PE CHAL RAHA QANJAR KAHO ALI AKBAR ASWS.</p>

<p>2. DARE QAYAAM SE RO RO KE DEKHO AY JAANI.</p>

<p>SADAAYE DETI HAIN MAADAR SUNO ALI AKBAR ASWS.</p>

<p>3. KOI BATATA NAHI TERI LAASH MAQTAL MEIN.</p>

<p>PIDAR NISAAR SADA PHIR SE DO ALI AKBAR ASWS.</p>

<p>4. YEH HAATH SEENE PE KYUN BAAR BAAR RAKHTE HO.</p>

<p>KAHAN PE ZAQM LAGAA HAI KAHO ALI AKBAR ASWS.</p>

<p>5. SINA KA PHAL MAIN NIKAALUN TUMHARE SEENE SE.</p>

<p>YEH HAATH ZAQME JIGAR PAR RAKHO ALI AKBAR ASWS.</p>

<p>6. PIDAR KE HAATHON PE AKBAR ASWS. KA TOOTA DUM MOMIN.</p>

<p>HUSSAIN ASWS. REH GAYE KEHTE UTHO ALI AKBAR ASWS.</p>

<p>
<center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB AKBAR ALI MOMIN SAHAB.</h4></center></p>
